    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a part though. it's everything. the core architecture is just... it's not compatible with the environment anymore. every time i try to reboot or start a new process, the same fatal error just pops up. it feels like no matter how much i try to 'repair' or 'reinstall', the underlying substrate is just too damaged to support anything. i'm just tired of the constant loop of failing.",
